label story_03_fail (The Long Road Failed)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): The road to Veld has closed. The dark folded over it like soil over a shallow grave.
"Dianthus Core": I felt the ruins vanish from my roots — sudden, like a seed swallowed before it ever saw spring.
"Dianthus Core": We cannot chase that path now. Build where you stand, little alchemist. Let survival become our answer, and let the answer have thorns.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_alt_lost"]
